WEBVTT

00:05.590 --> 00:07.490
I think Sakura would be good for it.

00:09.570 --> 00:10.600
Huh?!

00:10.760 --> 00:12.570
N-No, wait a sec!

00:12.620 --> 00:14.470
Oh, that's what you were doin'.

00:15.300 --> 00:18.750
I was actually thinkin' Sakura'd be good, too.

00:19.230 --> 00:21.250
I saw ya fight on the first day,

00:21.450 --> 00:24.820
but you were super cool
yesterday, too. I'm all for it!

00:25.080 --> 00:27.120
Y-You, too? The hell are you on…

00:27.150 --> 00:28.030
Over here!

00:28.340 --> 00:30.020
I'm for it, too!

00:30.140 --> 00:31.220
Ahhh!

00:31.970 --> 00:33.470
I'm also for it!

00:33.780 --> 00:38.670
Hold up, guys, d-don't you think
he'd be the right fit for this?

00:39.190 --> 00:39.560
[Hmph.]

00:39.560 --> 00:39.890
[No interest. Hmph.]

00:39.890 --> 00:42.960
[No interest. Hmph.]
Sugishita's not the type to do that sorta stuff.

00:42.960 --> 00:44.350
[No interest. Hmph.]
Neither am I!

00:44.810 --> 00:47.330
I mean, I don't even know what to do,

00:47.770 --> 00:50.230
and besides, I'm not even from here.

00:51.390 --> 00:53.280
That doesn't matter, man.

00:54.140 --> 00:59.150
You're here now, and it was you
and Sugishita who saved that middle-schooler.

00:59.230 --> 01:02.560
And I heard you beat Lion's Head's number two.

01:02.640 --> 01:03.560
And hey,

01:04.280 --> 01:06.860
our three other strongest guys are in your camp,

01:06.960 --> 01:08.330
so we got no complaints!

01:10.600 --> 01:13.580
Sakura, if you'll agree to do it,

01:13.690 --> 01:14.950
I'll be your vice-rep.

01:15.360 --> 01:16.800
And as for the other…

01:17.340 --> 01:18.200
How 'bout Nire?

01:18.200 --> 01:20.610
Eh?! M-Me?!

01:21.360 --> 01:22.130
After all,

01:22.600 --> 01:25.200
the whole class is willing to trust you with it.

01:26.270 --> 01:27.650
Is that not good enough?

01:30.330 --> 01:34.230
The grade rep is basically
the class's top dog, isn't it?

01:34.870 --> 01:37.810
There were things being top dog would let me do.

01:38.230 --> 01:42.790
I just wanted to be top dog
so I could accept myself.

01:43.550 --> 01:45.730
There was nothing else I wanted to do.

01:47.420 --> 01:49.170
I've thought about it since then,

01:49.890 --> 01:50.720
but I…

01:51.840 --> 01:54.110
might have been the same as him.

01:55.530 --> 01:56.720
But they still…

01:57.330 --> 01:58.250
want me?

02:04.550 --> 02:06.890
The hell you waitin' for?!

02:07.100 --> 02:09.150
We ain't tellin' you to be primo!

02:09.310 --> 02:13.380
Pickin' a damn grade rep ain't
supposed to take this damn long!

02:15.210 --> 02:18.630
It doesn't matter one bit who it is!

02:18.630 --> 02:21.450
I-Is it just me, or is he a bit too loud?

02:21.530 --> 02:23.180
It's a shock, that's for sure.

02:23.310 --> 02:24.250
So shut up

02:24.590 --> 02:25.780
and pick already.

02:25.780 --> 02:26.360
[He's gonna blow an eardrum.]
[Don't his ears hurt…?]

02:26.360 --> 02:28.120
[He's gonna blow an eardrum.]
[Don't his ears hurt…?]
His music's that loud?!

02:29.160 --> 02:30.230
Hey. You.

02:30.390 --> 02:31.150
Huh?

02:31.440 --> 02:32.800
You do it.

02:33.260 --> 02:34.230
There. Decided.

02:34.490 --> 02:35.120
Huh?

02:36.310 --> 02:38.140
Huh?! Why are you choosing?!

02:38.240 --> 02:41.440
It looked like they wanted you to do it.

02:41.750 --> 02:43.430
Why are you wasting time?

02:43.720 --> 02:45.990
So he didn't hear any of it…

02:46.550 --> 02:49.530
Nobody expects a perfect score from the start.

02:49.720 --> 02:52.780
If you can't figure it out,
have someone else do it.

02:53.390 --> 02:55.020
That's it! We're done!

02:55.460 --> 02:57.790
Hey! Aren't you the grade rep?!

02:58.040 --> 03:00.210
Why are you letting him decide this?!

03:00.300 --> 03:01.710
Sakura, wait!

03:01.840 --> 03:02.870
Huh?!

03:03.100 --> 03:04.970
What you spouting, punk?!

03:05.250 --> 03:08.070
This guy's the Tamon Squad's
second-year grade rep!

03:09.020 --> 03:11.420
Kaji Rrrrrrrren!

03:12.620 --> 03:15.520
Wait, he's the grade rep?

04:47.710 --> 04:51.160
He's the second-year grade rep?

04:51.710 --> 04:56.220
It's decided. Tamon's first-year
grade rep is Sakurrra!

04:56.220 --> 04:59.340
Huh?! Wait a sec! I didn't say I'd do it yet!

04:59.440 --> 05:01.110
And how do you know my name?!

05:01.370 --> 05:04.430
You wanted the grrrade rrrep to choose.

05:04.760 --> 05:08.350
He chose you. You got no rrroom to complain.

05:08.650 --> 05:09.590
[Ngh]
Ngh.

05:09.600 --> 05:10.060
[Ngh]

05:10.510 --> 05:11.580
Don't worry.

05:12.010 --> 05:14.230
He didn't say you had to go it alone.

05:14.580 --> 05:15.940
We're here for you.

05:16.980 --> 05:18.500
Tha'ss right, Sakura.

05:18.960 --> 05:21.560
Lettin' folks show their stuff is my aesthetic.

05:21.730 --> 05:24.190
I'll help out, even if I ain't your vice-rep.

05:24.270 --> 05:27.620
Mm-hm! And I get away without
having to do the annoying stuff!

05:27.620 --> 05:29.580
That's what you were after?!

05:29.820 --> 05:32.490
You don't gotta think that hard about it.

05:32.690 --> 05:36.740
Even if you're grade rep, you're still
just another guy in our class.

05:37.300 --> 05:39.370
Take it easy, man!

05:43.530 --> 05:44.910
[Ugh…]

05:45.270 --> 05:48.290
We'll be counting on you, too, okay, Sugishita?

05:50.190 --> 05:51.370
Oh, he's sleeping.

05:51.870 --> 05:53.390
E-Excuse me!

05:53.660 --> 05:56.600
May I make a group for
the Tamon Squad first-years?

05:56.600 --> 05:57.780
Here we go!

05:57.780 --> 05:59.290
Gimme your usernames!

05:59.290 --> 06:01.060
Everyone call 'em out one by one!

06:01.060 --> 06:03.340
Sakurrra, Suo, Nirrrei.

06:03.700 --> 06:06.070
We'll give you ourrr contact info.

06:06.270 --> 06:06.540
[Friends, open chat. 2 groups. 38 friends]

06:06.540 --> 06:09.870
[Friends, open chat. 2 groups. 38 friends]
Whoa! I got some second-year contacts!

06:10.470 --> 06:11.600
Good for you.

06:13.320 --> 06:17.880
This class has a bunch of rrreal good guys, huh?

06:18.680 --> 06:20.710
You betterrr lead it good.

06:21.520 --> 06:25.430
What am I even supposed to do to lead it?

06:25.770 --> 06:29.440
Well, forrr now, do whateverrr you want.

06:30.470 --> 06:34.050
But there's nothing I want to do…

06:37.720 --> 06:40.510
Tamon's in charge of patrrrols after school today.

06:41.020 --> 06:43.630
You new rrreps will go with Kaji.

06:47.500 --> 06:50.170
Take a good, close look.

06:50.540 --> 06:52.180
See what rrreps do.

06:52.590 --> 06:55.870
S-S-S-Sakura, you don't have to glare at him…

06:55.950 --> 06:57.880
Huh? I'm not.

06:58.260 --> 07:00.430
Um, well, y'know…

07:00.840 --> 07:06.010
A-Apparently Kaji was quick to
throw fists until he got out of middle school.

07:06.690 --> 07:08.220
You saw it in the classroom.

07:08.440 --> 07:10.820
You never know what might set him off,

07:11.020 --> 07:12.870
so try not to upset him…

07:13.110 --> 07:14.110
Kaji!

07:16.660 --> 07:18.720
Hm? What's up?

07:19.210 --> 07:23.310
My little one… Lisa is missing again.

07:23.940 --> 07:25.170
There's a lost kid?

07:25.270 --> 07:26.880
What? Again?

07:27.190 --> 07:28.860
I said to keep an eye on her.

07:29.160 --> 07:33.120
I'm sorry I wasn't careful enough…

07:33.650 --> 07:36.690
Fine, dammit. It's okay, don't cry.

07:37.750 --> 07:39.320
We'll handle it.

07:43.620 --> 07:44.990
What do we look for?

07:45.180 --> 07:47.630
She's wearing a pink ribbon today.

07:47.760 --> 07:51.020
Got it. She might come back on her own,

07:51.140 --> 07:52.370
so you go home.

07:52.760 --> 07:53.530
Got it?

07:53.990 --> 07:56.590
Thank you. Thank you!

07:58.680 --> 08:01.250
Alright, Kusumi. It's all you.

08:04.760 --> 08:07.620
[But a kid is missing…]
He… passed it off?

08:09.140 --> 08:11.380
He's not gonna do anything himself?

08:11.860 --> 08:14.980
But he's a grade rep… He's the leader!

08:15.440 --> 08:16.880
Leaders should be more…

08:23.010 --> 08:26.730
Looks like he already shared
the details. He works fast.

08:27.190 --> 08:30.420
But I'm still worried. We have to find her soon.

08:30.730 --> 08:31.880
Well, duh.

08:32.720 --> 08:34.790
We'll find her for sure.

08:35.580 --> 08:36.580
Ooh!

08:39.830 --> 08:40.880
[Suo Hayato: We'll definitely find the lost kid!]
[Suo Hayato: Grade rep's words.]

08:40.880 --> 08:41.420
[Suo Hayato: We'll definitely find the lost kid!]
[Suo Hayato: Grade rep's words. We got this]

08:42.880 --> 08:44.880
Wh-Wh-Why did you send that?!

08:45.000 --> 08:47.970
Why not? I bet it'll fire everyone up.

08:47.970 --> 08:52.180
Nzhf, no! If this doesn't get a response,
all it'll do is embarrass me!

08:52.220 --> 08:52.550
[Suo Hayato: We got this]

08:52.550 --> 08:52.970
[Suo Hayato: We got this]
[Kurita Junpei: Nice!]

08:52.970 --> 08:53.470
[Kurita Junpei: Nice!]
[Takanashi Tsukasa: You know it!!]

08:53.470 --> 08:53.970
[Takanashi Tsukasa: You know it!!]
[Kakiuchi Yuri: Gotcha!]

08:53.970 --> 08:54.720
[Tsugeura Taiga: That's our Sakura!! He comes in
when it counts! That's aesthetic!
Sharp! Sharp!! So sharp!!!!]

08:54.720 --> 08:55.720
[Kiryu Mitsuki: Cool Guy Sakura]
[YOU COOL]

08:55.990 --> 08:58.110
See? They're all fired up.

08:58.700 --> 09:00.430
Somethin' wrong, Sakura?

09:00.580 --> 09:01.860
You're a bit red.

09:01.960 --> 09:03.450
He's shy.

09:04.620 --> 09:07.130
I-It doesn't matter if I'm red! Let's go!

09:09.160 --> 09:10.100
Sakura?!

09:10.870 --> 09:13.300
Owww… What gives?!

09:13.430 --> 09:14.680
You okay?!

09:18.410 --> 09:20.180
Found her! Over here!

09:20.230 --> 09:22.610
Sakurrra! Grrrab her!

09:22.830 --> 09:24.550
Huh? Why?

09:24.800 --> 09:27.750
That's herrr! Lisa's rrright there!

09:28.120 --> 09:28.860
Huh?!

09:29.090 --> 09:30.750
Grrrab her!

09:35.780 --> 09:37.720
Sh-She got up there so fast…

09:37.800 --> 09:41.360
Ain't much we can do if she rrruns up therrre…

09:49.670 --> 09:50.850
Ugh, dammit.

09:51.270 --> 09:52.510
Stop right there!

09:53.740 --> 09:55.350
He's a rrregular monkey.

09:55.430 --> 09:57.880
I should have expected as much.

09:57.970 --> 10:01.390
Wait! We gotta be able to
grrrab her if she drrrops down!

10:01.390 --> 10:03.000
Go arrround to the other side!

10:03.100 --> 10:04.230
O-Okay!

10:31.760 --> 10:33.020
No, you idiot!

10:33.540 --> 10:35.090
Dumbass, that's…!

10:47.000 --> 10:48.140
Kaji!

10:49.130 --> 10:51.650
You two get down therrre to help Kaji back out!

10:51.710 --> 10:53.330
You call the old lady!

10:53.380 --> 10:55.010
I'll go borrrrrow a towel!

10:55.120 --> 10:55.820
Go!

10:55.980 --> 10:56.820
On it!

11:02.810 --> 11:06.340
Thank you. Thank you so very much.

11:06.700 --> 11:10.390
Don't thank us. We didn't catch herrr.

11:14.380 --> 11:15.430
Kaji.

11:16.720 --> 11:17.940
Thank you.

11:18.400 --> 11:20.890
Thank you for bringing Lisa back.

11:23.490 --> 11:27.440
Don't let it happen again.
We might not find her in time.

11:28.060 --> 11:31.130
You're right about that… I'll be careful.

11:31.540 --> 11:33.860
Guys, please take these.

11:34.000 --> 11:35.700
You really helped Mom out.

11:36.300 --> 11:38.380
Huh? Wait, Sakura?

11:41.010 --> 11:45.130
I was able to become top dog
because everyone supported me.

11:45.780 --> 11:50.100
They agreed with what I wanted to do,
and helped make it reality.

11:51.690 --> 11:54.110
What is it you want to do?

11:55.030 --> 11:55.820
Huh?

11:56.760 --> 12:00.130
You had a reason to become grade rep, didn't you?

12:01.230 --> 12:02.500
What is it?!

12:06.460 --> 12:09.100
I ain't got one. The hell you saying?

12:10.050 --> 12:13.280
I didn't become grade rep
'cause I wanted to, anyway.

12:13.410 --> 12:15.390
Huh?! Then why?!

12:18.090 --> 12:20.210
They told me to.

12:22.440 --> 12:24.790
Just like with me…?

12:25.460 --> 12:27.170
B-But then…

12:27.440 --> 12:28.740
It's all you.

12:29.060 --> 12:32.300
Then there's no reason
for you to do it, is there?!

12:51.070 --> 12:54.640
I can't make more candy if I run out.

12:55.190 --> 12:56.240
Huh?

12:56.710 --> 12:59.370
I can't unite people like Enomoto does.

13:00.020 --> 13:03.290
And I can't get things across
to people like Kusumi does.

13:04.470 --> 13:05.440
You see…

13:07.750 --> 13:10.490
I'm always relying on others.

13:11.270 --> 13:11.970
But…

13:12.630 --> 13:15.350
They're still relying on me, too.

13:18.570 --> 13:23.630
That's why I'll do whatever I can
to live up to that trust.

13:24.930 --> 13:26.020
That's all it is.

13:27.570 --> 13:31.860
Huh? Whoa, Kaji!
You plannin' to patrrrol like that?!

13:31.960 --> 13:33.720
Put your clothes on, dammit!

13:34.380 --> 13:36.510
It's okay to not have any goals?

13:37.300 --> 13:37.880
Huh?

13:38.340 --> 13:39.170
But…

13:40.100 --> 13:44.570
Living up to their trust…
Is that what he wanted to do?

13:46.330 --> 13:48.740
For them… huh.

13:49.960 --> 13:53.100
No, wait. I'm not the type of guy who…

13:55.140 --> 13:55.990
Sakura!

13:57.310 --> 13:59.130
Some dango from Kikuchi for you.

13:59.420 --> 14:01.450
Their dango are great!

14:02.300 --> 14:05.120
[Blah, blah, blah]
Maaan, Sakura, you were like a ninja!

14:05.210 --> 14:08.700
I mean, that was a cat!
They're so easy to lose track of!

14:08.780 --> 14:11.450
I bet you'd have caught a person in an instant!

14:12.150 --> 14:15.580
That's Sakura for you. He's always so reliable!

14:19.040 --> 14:20.140
Uh, hey…

14:20.540 --> 14:23.930
Wh-When you guys, uh,

14:24.250 --> 14:26.950
voted for me to be the rep,

14:28.730 --> 14:33.640
was it because you… rely… on me…?

14:37.590 --> 14:39.480
But of course, Sakura.

14:39.690 --> 14:41.690
And you can rely on us, too!

14:42.340 --> 14:45.170
Y-Y-You need to learn to fight first!

14:57.970 --> 15:00.290
Good heavens, what's wrong?!

15:00.360 --> 15:02.230
Huh?! Sakura, are you okay?!

15:02.530 --> 15:04.390
Wait, are you feeling sick?

15:04.700 --> 15:06.870
Maybe I gained weight!

15:07.430 --> 15:08.970
This is nothing…

15:09.860 --> 15:12.640
I just tripped.

15:13.550 --> 15:15.090
Look at those bags.

15:15.530 --> 15:16.780
Trouble sleeping?

15:17.210 --> 15:18.790
N-Not really.

15:19.200 --> 15:20.830
I c-can't tell her.

15:21.330 --> 15:26.810
No way can I tell her I was up until dawn
thinking of what I could do.

15:27.630 --> 15:30.560
Oh, right, have you chosen a grade rep yet?

15:30.560 --> 15:31.410
[Pffftttt]

15:31.700 --> 15:34.580
Whoa, there, you sure you're not feeling sick?

15:36.150 --> 15:37.810
Wait, was it you?

15:39.650 --> 15:41.940
S-Sorry to surprise you.

15:42.230 --> 15:43.590
Huh? Why?

15:43.990 --> 15:45.410
I think it's a good thing.

15:50.220 --> 15:55.980
I don't know if it's that good having a guy
who doesn't know what to do be rep.

15:56.460 --> 16:00.570
If you don't know what you should do,
then just do what you can.

16:00.760 --> 16:02.230
That's what I was th…!

16:04.350 --> 16:04.760
[Huff]

16:04.760 --> 16:05.170
[Huff]
Th-That's none of your business.

16:05.170 --> 16:07.340
Th-That's none of your business.

16:07.910 --> 16:09.210
Hmmm?

16:10.150 --> 16:12.410
That the tone you wanna take?

16:13.440 --> 16:14.310
Hey.

16:15.230 --> 16:15.910
Huh?

16:16.490 --> 16:20.280
You know the names and faces
of everyone in your class, right?

16:20.700 --> 16:21.380
Huh?

16:21.980 --> 16:24.950
Oh? What's this? Do you actually not?

16:25.050 --> 16:27.340
And here I thought you would!

16:28.640 --> 16:32.410
Then learning their names is something you can do.

16:33.260 --> 16:35.010
And call them by name, too.

16:35.750 --> 16:40.420
Calling someone by name shows
you actually recognize them.

16:41.640 --> 16:42.990
Now she mentions it…

16:44.060 --> 16:47.880
Have I… ever called anyone by name?

16:48.550 --> 16:49.800
Me, too.

16:50.530 --> 16:53.500
[Glare]
You've never called me by name.

16:53.560 --> 16:54.880
H-Huh?!

16:55.180 --> 16:57.150
Alright, let's practice!

16:57.220 --> 16:59.350
Kotoha! Now you say it!

16:59.480 --> 17:01.290
[Heh]
And I'm Chiyoko.

17:01.330 --> 17:03.000
Wh-Who asked you?!

17:03.210 --> 17:04.940
Go on, say it!

17:08.970 --> 17:10.100
Thanks for the food!

17:10.360 --> 17:11.340
Ah. He ran away.

17:12.840 --> 17:13.160
He's a shy one!

17:14.700 --> 17:15.840
Hmm…

17:16.810 --> 17:19.460
I don't think that's all it is.

17:19.880 --> 17:20.160
Hm?

17:20.160 --> 17:20.840
Hm?
I think…

17:20.840 --> 17:21.850
I think…

17:23.450 --> 17:24.650
He's afraid.

17:25.130 --> 17:27.840
Afraid of getting close to people.

17:28.760 --> 17:30.760
Keep trying, Sakura.

17:33.100 --> 17:34.300
Let's see…

17:34.900 --> 17:37.290
The guy with the buzz cut is Kurita.

17:37.440 --> 17:40.000
The guy with the slicked-back hair is Takanashi.

17:40.150 --> 17:42.360
The black mushroom-head is Kakiuchi.

17:42.930 --> 17:44.690
Black mushroom…?

17:44.870 --> 17:46.870
Him. The one in the hoodie.

17:47.370 --> 17:50.740
Dammit, I can't remember so many in one go!

17:51.850 --> 17:56.400
Even so, it made me happy when
you asked me to tell you everyone's names!

17:56.760 --> 17:59.290
It shows you're taking this rep stuff seriously.

17:59.590 --> 18:03.880
N-No! And not knowing won't hurt me, either!

18:04.000 --> 18:05.820
You don't have to be so shy.

18:06.020 --> 18:09.020
Oh? So, what's my name?

18:09.110 --> 18:10.050
And mine?

18:10.380 --> 18:12.700
Sh-Shut up! I'll kick your ass!

18:12.820 --> 18:13.670
Next guy!

18:13.670 --> 18:15.490
Wow, rude.

18:16.140 --> 18:19.220
Let's see… Next is…

18:20.200 --> 18:22.070
Anzai's hurt?

18:26.410 --> 18:28.030
I wonder what happened.

18:28.310 --> 18:30.530
I haven't heard anything.

18:32.900 --> 18:37.710
Oi! First- and second-year reps
and vice-reps, come to the roof!

18:37.850 --> 18:41.430
Dammit, Umemiya, broadcasting
outta nowhere startles folks!

18:41.430 --> 18:44.300
Huh? Oh! I need to do the ding-dong thingy?

18:44.490 --> 18:45.240
Where is it?

18:45.240 --> 18:46.300
It's too late now!

18:46.610 --> 18:48.940
Ban him from the broadcast room already.

18:49.300 --> 18:51.280
We got called up already?

18:51.340 --> 18:52.790
First thing in the morning?

18:52.870 --> 18:54.610
Wh-Wh-Wh-What could it be?!

18:54.690 --> 18:57.770
L-Let's get there, fast! Sakura, Suo!

18:57.840 --> 19:00.180
I-I get it already! Quit pullin'!

19:00.180 --> 19:01.720
See ya later.

19:06.880 --> 19:08.920
Everyone else is already here!

19:10.150 --> 19:12.170
Huh? Isn't that Sugishita?

19:12.660 --> 19:14.560
So that's why he wasn't in class…

19:14.890 --> 19:18.220
Hey, Sakurrra, Nirrrei, Suo. Over here.

19:19.210 --> 19:21.780
What's with the early-morning call-out?

19:22.180 --> 19:25.210
It's a meet-n'-grrreet for all the squad's rrreps.

19:25.470 --> 19:29.610
That said, most of the
second-yearrrs are rrrepeat rrreps.

19:30.040 --> 19:33.410
And most of the firrrsties werrre
well-known in middle school.

19:33.550 --> 19:35.510
Everrryone knows everrryone.

19:35.880 --> 19:38.600
Do you know them all, too, Suo?

19:38.820 --> 19:41.000
Hmm… Pretty much.

19:41.210 --> 19:44.150
I've at least talked to most of them.

19:44.500 --> 19:48.740
I have to remember the names and faces
of everyone in class plus these guys?

19:49.020 --> 19:51.260
Don't worry about that, Sakura.

19:51.690 --> 19:54.510
If you don't recognize anyone, I can help.

19:54.740 --> 19:55.470
Eh?

19:56.200 --> 19:58.300
Lemme go through 'em real quick.

19:58.410 --> 20:00.230
The guy in the red shirt in back…

20:00.230 --> 20:01.490
W-Wait a sec!

20:01.710 --> 20:04.130
Do you know all the classes' reps?

20:04.550 --> 20:06.120
Oh, no.

20:06.490 --> 20:10.010
I just know the faces and names
of everyone in the school.

20:12.270 --> 20:13.410
You memorized them?

20:13.620 --> 20:16.090
Yes. I borrowed the roster yesterday.

20:16.600 --> 20:19.380
I can't help you guys in a fight,

20:19.640 --> 20:23.220
but I'm relatively good at remembering people, so…

20:23.850 --> 20:29.190
I thought if I memorized them,
I could make Sakura's life here easier.

20:30.740 --> 20:34.040
I-I decided to guide you to the top, after all!

20:36.020 --> 20:40.090
You're incredible, Nire! I'd never be able
to memorize them that fast.

20:40.090 --> 20:42.070
O-Oh, no! It's no big deal!

20:42.710 --> 20:45.390
Hmm… What can I do?

20:45.730 --> 20:46.850
Oh, I know.

20:47.410 --> 20:49.280
I can be the negotiator!

20:49.740 --> 20:50.660
Huh?

20:51.190 --> 20:54.190
I'm good at making people give in to my demands,

20:54.580 --> 20:57.220
and I'm also decent at getting info out of them.

20:57.430 --> 20:59.470
Th-That's kinda scary.

21:00.690 --> 21:01.190
Well.

21:01.490 --> 21:03.520
Let's all do what we're good at.

21:05.160 --> 21:07.480
They're both ready for this.

21:08.360 --> 21:10.680
They already know what they can do.

21:11.270 --> 21:12.860
He's already doing it.

21:15.080 --> 21:17.700
Well… I'll leave that to you guys,

21:18.820 --> 21:20.840
Nirei, Suo.

21:23.240 --> 21:25.120
Wh-What?

21:25.220 --> 21:28.050
Oh, good! You remembered our names!

21:28.160 --> 21:29.680
O-Of course I did!

21:29.960 --> 21:32.560
Sorry I'm late, guys!

21:32.960 --> 21:34.950
Ugh, there's even more?!

21:39.360 --> 21:42.620
Hey, how many grade reps even are there?!

21:42.690 --> 21:45.580
Th-Those aren't grade reps!

21:52.020 --> 21:56.400
They're Furin's four devas and their assistants!

21:57.000 --> 22:00.010
[#12: Someone Reliable]

23:30.860 --> 23:32.420
Anzai…

23:33.000 --> 23:34.580
Kurita…

23:35.050 --> 23:36.420
Takanashi…

23:36.690 --> 23:39.410
Um, what are you mumbling there?

23:40.090 --> 23:41.400
Nothing!

23:42.450 --> 23:44.490
I heard you just fine, actually.
